        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Electricity, low voltage, residual mix</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity, low voltage, residual mix
This dataset describes the transformation from medium to low voltage as well as the distribution of electricity at low voltage.\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Elektrizität\nLocal subcategory: Erzeugungsmix\nUVEK 2022 source file:726-Strommixe-EU_v0.8._X-Residual Mix Distribution.xml\n\n
UUID: 761309ba-d86e-3209-9366-7b9ccd9519aa
Included are the electricity production in PL, the transmission network as well as direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during low-voltage transmission and transformation from medium-voltage are accounted for.
Location: undefined
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
