Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_761309ba-d86e-3209-9366-7b9ccd9519aa.xml</text>
